[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Comments
[/meta]

h1. Comments

Tests for Section 20 of the specification.

h3. Comments are removed {#comments-removed}
[code om]
Before.

[comment]
This content will not appear in output.
Can span multiple lines.
[/comment]

After.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Before.</p>
<p>After.</p>
[/code]

h3. Markup inside a comment is ignored {#comments-markup-ignored}
[code om]
[comment]
[note]
*not parsed*
[/comment]
[/code]
[code html]
[/code]

h3. A comment between paragraph lines keeps one paragraph {#comments-inside-paragraph}
[code om]
Line one.
[comment]
Hidden.
[/comment]
Line two.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Line one.<br>
Line two.</p>
[/code]

h3. Comments are allowed inside containers {#comments-in-containers}
[code om]
[quote]
[comment]
Hidden.
[/comment]
Quoted.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>Quoted.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. A comment between list items {#comments-in-list}
[code om]
* One
[comment]
Hidden.
[/comment]
* Two
[/code]
[code html]
<ul>
<li>One</li>
<li>Two</li>
</ul>
[/code]

h3. Unclosed comment {#comments-unclosed}
[code om]
[comment]
Never closed.
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h3. Comment mid-line {#comments-mid-line}
[code om]
Text [comment]hidden[/comment]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Allowed in the basic profile {#comments-profile-basic}
; profile
: basic
[code om]
Shown.

[comment]
Hidden.
[/comment]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Shown.</p>
[/code]

h3. Not allowed in the inline profile {#comments-profile-inline}
; profile
: inline
[code om]
[comment]
Hidden.
[/comment]
[/code]
[code error]
feature-not-in-profile 1
[/code]

h3. A closing tag after text is comment content {#comments-close-after-text}
[code om]
[comment]
Hidden.[/comment]
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h3. A closing tag after text does not end the comment {#comments-close-after-text-continues}
[code om]
[comment]
Hidden.[/comment]
Still hidden.
[/comment]
Shown.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Shown.</p>
[/code]
